<!-- Product Management Content -->
<section>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-8" align="justify">
                <h3><b>Driving Product Growth</b></h3>
                <p>Product growth depends on continuously understanding user behavior, measuring outcomes, and improving the customer experience. iFOX Solutions helps organizations identify opportunities to increase adoption, engagement, and business value.</p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Track product performance against defined business and customer goals.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Identify opportunities to improve user adoption and engagement.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Use product analytics to support data-driven decisions.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Prioritize enhancements based on customer and business impact.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Build a continuous improvement culture around the product.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul><br />
                <h3><b>Optimizing the Product Experience</b></h3>
                <p>Ongoing optimization helps products remain useful, competitive, and aligned with customer expectations. We use feedback, analytics, and performance insights to guide product improvements.</p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Product Analytics: Monitor meaningful metrics across adoption, engagement, retention, and performance.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Customer Feedback: Use direct feedback to understand friction points and improvement opportunities.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Feature Optimization: Improve existing capabilities based on usage and customer value.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Experience Improvement: Identify areas where usability and customer journeys can be improved.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Performance Monitoring: Track product outcomes and continuously evaluate improvement initiatives.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4 Imgborder">
                <div><img src="~/assets/img/dynamics365/woman analyzing-checking-finance-graphs-office.webp" class="img-fluid text-center m-3" /></div>
                <div><img src="~/assets/img/dynamics365/mod woman-equipped-computer-lab.webp" class="img-fluid text-center m-3" /></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
